      "rhyme_vowel": "A"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "In lak'ech, planetary kin (\"Step aside, boy...\")",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Red overtone dragon make your barathary spin (V-Villain!)",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "In the flesh with a band of merry men",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Innocent civilians hari kari over yen (\"Uh!\")",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Is it the end or for pretend?",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I can neither condemn, nor defend",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Cats that's more pussy than a sanitary napkin bin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Villain ran a scam on his imaginary rappin' friend (\"Uh!\")",
          "rhyme": ")d",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Again; shame on us",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "We in the same game, put the blame on Gus",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Study till your brain vomit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Just don't be out gettin' muddy when it rain comets",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Armpits of funk, a bomb in the hunk-a-junk trunk",
          "rhyme": "9nk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Metal Palm on your mom's ba-dunk-a-dunk",
          "rhyme": "9nk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "In a park in a rave under three days of darkness",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Tell a hater, \"Behave and spark this\"",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Winter fresh banana berry blend (\"Step aside, boy...\")",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Countin' mad tens than when January begin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "The other hand clutched to a pen",
          "rhyme": "@n",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "24/7—much to his chagrin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Used to drink gin, now he only drink oxygen water",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Mixed with shark fins that cleanse the toxins, sorta",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "And if they ever come get me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "We were sippin' rum on the number one jitney (Ya wit' me?)",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "I can neither confirm, nor deny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "On account of the sherm—all high",
          "rhyme": "Eg",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Villain make 'er squirm till 'er perm all dry",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Sperm to 'er eye, to a worm, to a fly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "It's germs and mad babies to kiss",
          "rhyme": "ajs",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Won't stop rockin', 'cept to maybe take a piss",
          "rhyme": "ajs",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Or soak his feet in a mineral oil vat (\"Step aside...\")",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Holdin' a Rodin coil in his tin foil hat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Step aside, give him some room, player (\"Step aside, boy...\")",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Till the end of days he'll be the ill DOOMSAYER",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
